<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#Evaluator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Any agent that produces it6:Evaluation instances linked to a shared SharedEvaluationContext (via daimo:usesEvaluationContext) holds an Evaluator role — for example, a benchmarking team comparing candidate models on the same dataset version, protocol and, when applicable, seed."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#randomSeed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A holdout or k-fold protocol that shuffles folds records daimo:randomSeed 42; a fully deterministic leave-one-out protocol omits the property."@en .
