<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#CrossParticipantProvenanceRecord> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reusable semantic bundle that aggregates prov:Activity and prov:Entity across participant contexts to tell one audit-ready story."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#ParticipantRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#exposedAs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a deployment to the DCAT data service(s) that expose it. Non-functional: one deployment may expose multiple endpoints (e.g., a REST service plus a gRPC service, or regional load-balanced endpoints). Each exposed service is paired with the contract that describes it through daimo:forService (IOContract -> DataService); SHACL invariant INV-8 requires every exposed service to have at least one such contract."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#inputSchema> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#derivedFromAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/Agreement> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#ModelProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#hasOffering> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#AIAssetOffering> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#contextDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#SharedEvaluationContext> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#ExecutionAuthorization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "After a successful DSP contract negotiation the accepted terms are represented as an odrl:Agreement; a distinct ExecutionAuthorization then declares daimo:derivedFromAgreement that agreement, grants execution to the consumer (daimo:grantedTo), covers one or more runs via daimo:authorizesRun, and expires at a daimo:expiresAt timestamp."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#outputSchema> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#randomSeed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#SharedEvaluationContext> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#datasetVersion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#contextTask> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "context task"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#ModelProvider> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#authorizesRun> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an authorization to a run it permits. Non-functional: a single authorization can cover multiple runs (e.g., subscription-style access). Asymmetric: an authorization is distinct from any run it authorises. Deliberately NOT declared a subproperty of prov:used: a daimo:ExecutionAuthorization is a governed artefact (a prov:Entity), not a prov:Activity; the prov:used domain would incorrectly force ExecutionAuthorization ⊑ prov:Activity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#authorizesRun> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#spansParticipantContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#datasetVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#SharedEvaluationContext> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#AuditEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#onInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "on infrastructure"@en .
_:ne83e70ac7f56477da30889730e5f818db9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:ne83e70ac7f56477da30889730e5f818db10 .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#protocol> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#outputFormat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "output format"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#authorizesRun> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#Evaluator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Role of an agent that evaluates or compares AI models under a shared evaluation context."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#contextDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#ModelDeployment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A running or hosted instance of a machine-learning model exposed through one or more DCAT data services over a named compute infrastructure, under a per-service I/O contract."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#offeredBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "offered by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#AIAssetOffering> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AI asset offering"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#inputFormat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#IOContract> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#GovernanceActor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An external compliance body that reads CrossParticipantProvenanceRecord bundles and AuditEvidence records to verify lawful execution holds a GovernanceActor role — for example, a regulator or a conformance-labelling body."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#hasIOContract> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a deployment to its invocation contract(s). Non-functional: a deployment exposing multiple services (see daimo:exposedAs) may carry a distinct IOContract per protocol (e.g., JSON+OAuth2 for REST and protobuf+mTLS for gRPC). Each contract records which exposed service it applies to via daimo:forService, so a multi-service deployment never requires a cartesian join between services and contracts."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#DerivedArtifact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "derived artifact"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#forService> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#hasRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#derivedFromAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The ExecutionAuthorization granting flood-risk-v2 execution to Leganés declares daimo:derivedFromAgreement the odrl:Agreement produced by the UPM–Leganés contract negotiation, so the concrete run authorisation is traceable back to the exact accepted terms."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#hasIOContract> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#IOContract> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#randomSeed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#forService> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#PlatformOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A dataspace platform provider hosting one or more ModelDeployments, signing AuditEvidence records, and running the EDC connector acts as a PlatformOperator in each participant context it administers."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#hasDeployment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has deployment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#AuditEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "For each run of a deployed model, the PlatformOperator produces an AuditEvidence record that references the run (daimo:evidenceOf), carries a structured spdx:Checksum (algorithm + digest) over the run's outputs (daimo:integrityHash), identifies the signer (daimo:signedBy), and timestamps the sealing (daimo:recordedAt)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#hasAuditEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#randomSeed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#hasOfferPolicy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#AIAssetOffering> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#recordedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#spansParticipantContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/edc/v0.0.1/ns/ParticipantContext> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "See the companion documents ONTOLOGY-REFERENCE.md (class-by-class reference), VALIDATION-MATRIX.md (traceability), and daimo-ontology-design.md (design rationale) in the source repository."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#Evaluator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Role of an agent that evaluates or compares AI models under a shared evaluation context."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#contextFlow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "context flow"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#deploysModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://data.europa.eu/it6/MachineLearningModel> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#evidenceOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#AuditEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#authorizedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of daimo:authorizesRun. Functional: each run is authorized by exactly one authorization."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#DerivedArtifact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A governed, catalog-describable output produced by an it6:Run in a dataspace context, bearing its own provenance and policy."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#recordedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
