<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#randomSeed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "random seed"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#ExecutionAuthorization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "execution authorization"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#derivedFromRun> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://data.europa.eu/it6/Run> .
