<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#ModelConsumer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Role of an agent that discovers, negotiates access to, and invokes AI models offered by a Model Provider."@en .
_:ne83e70ac7f56477da30889730e5f818db10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#SharedEvaluationContext> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#forService> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The DCAT data service (deployment endpoint) that a given I/O contract describes."@en .
