<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#inParticipantContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Scopes a role assignment to a specific EDC participant context. Functional: a role instance is held within exactly one context."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#onInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#offeredBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#usesEvaluationContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#SharedEvaluationContext> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#protocol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Name of the evaluation protocol (e.g. \"holdout\", \"5-fold-cv\", \"leave-one-out\", \"bootstrap-1000\"). Whether a random seed applies is a property of this procedure, not of DAIMO: stochastic protocols typically declare daimo:randomSeed; deterministic ones omit it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#datasetVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#grantedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an execution authorization to the grantee agent it authorises. Functional: one grantee per authorization. Deliberately NOT declared rdfs:subPropertyOf odrl:assignee: odrl:assignee has domain odrl:Policy, so — now that daimo:ExecutionAuthorization is no longer an odrl:Agreement/odrl:Policy — that alignment would re-type every authorization as an odrl:Policy and reintroduce the very conflation DAIMO-ISSUE-02 removes. The intended equivalence (the authorization's grantee IS the odrl:assignee of the agreement it derives from) is instead enforced by SHACL invariant INV-9 rather than by OWL subsumption. Also deliberately NOT aligned to prov:qualifiedAssociation, whose range is a reified prov:Association object, not the agent itself."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#" .
