<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#expiresAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expiry timestamp of the execution authorisation — the operational window during which the derived authorization may cover runs. The accepted odrl:Agreement may carry its own ODRL constraints; expiry of the authorization is recorded here, not on the agreement."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pionera/daimo#recordedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Timestamp at which the audit evidence was sealed."@en .
